abstract: >-
  Comprehensive medical licensing exam preparation skill for Chinese clinical
  medical students. Covers both practical skills exam and medical comprehensive
  written exam. Provides knowledge lookup, question practice, case analysis
  training, and skills simulation based on official NHC syllabus and PMPH
  textbooks.
